{"text": "Boys came by all afternoon. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And each one stayed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To whitewash. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When Ben was tired. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Billy Fisher paid a kite. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For the next turn. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then Johnny Miller bought in with a dead rat. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And a string. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To swing it with. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> By the evening. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Tom was rich. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With treasures. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He had marbles. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A piece of blue glass. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A key that opened nothing. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And a one eyed kitten. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The fence had three coats. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Of whitewash on it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If he had not run out of whitewash. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Every boy in the village. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Would have been bankrupt. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Tom had discovered. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A great law of human action. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Without knowing it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To make someone want a thing. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You only need to make it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Hard to get. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Work is what a person must do and play is what a person does not have to do.", "alignment": {"characters": ["B", "o", "y", "s", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", " ", "b", "y", " ", "a", "l", "l", " ", "a", "f", "t", "e", "r", "n", "o", "o", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "n", "d", " ", "e", "a", "c", "h", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "s", "t", "a", "y", "e", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "o", " ", "w", "h", "i", "t", "e", "w", "a", "s", "h", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", 